Fast Enterprise Recon
nmap -Pn -n -T4 --top-ports 1000 target
Full TCP Scan
nmap -Pn -n -sS -p- target
Full Enumeration
nmap -Pn -sC -sV -O target
SMB Enumeration
nmap -p445 --script smb-enum-shares,smb-enum-users target
Web Enumeration
nmap -p80,443 -sV --script http-enum,http-title target
SSL Assessment
nmap --script ssl-cert,ssl-enum-ciphers -p443 target

This is often the first scan against a known live host because it quickly identifies common services without waiting for a full 65,535-port scan.

Example Output

You might discover:

22 SSH
80 HTTP
443 HTTPS
