3389 RDP

nmap -Pn -n -T4 --top-ports 1000 target

| Option | Meaning                      |
| ------ | ---------------------------- |
| `-Pn`  | Assume host is alive         |
| `-n`   | No DNS lookups               |
| `-sS`  | SYN (Stealth) scan           |
| `-p-`  | Scan all TCP ports (1-65535) |

nmap -Pn -n -sS -p- target

| Service | Typical Port | Actual Port |
| ------- | ------------ | ----------- |
| HTTP    | 80           | 8080        |
| SSH     | 22           | 2222        |
| SQL     | 1433         | 51433       |

nmap -Pn -sC -sV -O target
| Option | Meaning                 |
| ------ | ----------------------- |
| `-Pn`  | Assume host is up       |
| `-sC`  | Run default NSE scripts |
| `-sV`  | Detect service versions |
| `-O`   | Detect operating system |

